{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function injectHeldKeyCodes(): Signal<Record<string, string>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHeldKeyCodes.ts#L28","children":[{"type":"text","value":"injectHeldKeyCodes.ts:28"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular inject-based API that returns a signal of a map from held key names to their physical "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"event.code"},{"type":"text","value":" values."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Useful for debugging which physical key was pressed (e.g. distinguishing\nleft vs right Shift via \"ShiftLeft\" / \"ShiftRight\")."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Signal"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Record"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Signal of record mapping normalized key names to their "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"event.code"},{"type":"text","value":" values"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"@Component({\n  template: `\n    @for (key of heldKeys(); track key) {\n      <kbd>{{ key }} <small>{{ heldCodes()[key] }}</small></kbd>\n    }\n  `,\n})\nexport class KeyDebugComponent {\n  heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n  heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction injectHeldKeyCodes(): Signal<Record<string, string>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectHeldKeyCodes.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHeldKeyCodes.ts#L28)\n\nAngular inject-based API that returns a signal of a map from held key names to their physical `event.code` values.\n\nUseful for debugging which physical key was pressed (e.g. distinguishing\nleft vs right Shift via \"ShiftLeft\" / \"ShiftRight\").\n\n## Returns\n\n`Signal`\\<`Record`\\<`string`, `string`\\>\\>\n\nSignal of record mapping normalized key names to their `event.code` values\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    @for (key of heldKeys(); track key) {\n      <kbd>{{ key }} <small>{{ heldCodes()[key] }}</small></kbd>\n    }\n  `,\n})\nexport class KeyDebugComponent {\n  heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n  heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: injectHeldKeyCodes\ntitle: injectHeldKeyCodes\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction injectHeldKeyCodes(): Signal<Record<string, string>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [injectHeldKeyCodes.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/angular-hotkeys/src/injectHeldKeyCodes.ts#L28)\n\nAngular inject-based API that returns a signal of a map from held key names to their physical `event.code` values.\n\nUseful for debugging which physical key was pressed (e.g. distinguishing\nleft vs right Shift via \"ShiftLeft\" / \"ShiftRight\").\n\n## Returns\n\n`Signal`\\<`Record`\\<`string`, `string`\\>\\>\n\nSignal of record mapping normalized key names to their `event.code` values\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n@Component({\n  template: `\n    @for (key of heldKeys(); track key) {\n      <kbd>{{ key }} <small>{{ heldCodes()[key] }}</small></kbd>\n    }\n  `,\n})\nexport class KeyDebugComponent {\n  heldKeys = injectHeldKeys()\n  heldCodes = injectHeldKeyCodes()\n}\n```\n"}
